                <h5>APR 17, 2024</h5>
                <h4>AI-Driven Agent Training: A Paradigm Shift for Contact Centers</h4>
                <p>In this LinkedIn Live event, Forrester and [24]7.ai discussed how generative AI is transforming contact centers with quick, cost-effective, and efficient agent onboarding.</p>
                <p> Virtual Event</p>
                <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-33baad31 elementor-align-left elementor-mobile-align-center elementor-widget elementor-widget-ld_button" data-id="33baad31" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="ld_button.default">
