            <div class="row-one slide-row">
                <h5>JUN 05, 2024</h5>
                <h4>[24]7.ai Receives Multiple Gold Awards from the Prestigious USCXA '24</h4>
                <p>[24]7.ai, a leader in CX services and solutions, has received two Gold Awards for Best Contact Center and Best Customer Service (over 1000 employees). These wins celebrate [24]7.ai's relentless dedication to creating exceptional CX and building world-class omnichannel contact center solutions.</p>
                <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-33baad31 elementor-align-left elementor-mobile-align-center elementor-widget elementor-widget-ld_button" data-id="33baad31" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="ld_button.default">
